# Frozen reference data for the Lean verification executable

Two datasets and two matching reference blocks, both produced by
`verification/python/ab_cloud_verify.py` (the 10-language suite's Python
reference implementation) from the frozen dataset
`verification/data/zeta_zeros_50000.txt`:

* `EMBED` — the first 256 zeros, embedded as literals, so that
  `lake exe abcloud-verify --embedded` always runs, even outside a full
  repository checkout;
* `REF_MAIN` — the 5000-zero reference block (the numbers the main check
  compares against).

The tolerances absorb libm round-off differences between ecosystems; the
executable verifies every value to those tolerances and fails loudly
otherwise.
-/

